      "basis_id": "BASIS-001",
      "type": "需求",
      "source_refs": "docs/software-design/product-design.md",
      "content": "用户原始需求：REQ-20260507-001。做一个 web 版加法器，有两个输入框，输入数字后实时显示相加之和。",
      "must_cover": true,
      "status": "in_scope"
    },
    {
      "basis_id": "BASIS-002",
      "type": "验收标准",
      "source_refs": "docs/software-design/product-design.md",
      "content": "页面可双击在浏览器直接打开；有兩個數字輸入框；輸入數字後實時顯示相加結果；非法輸入有錯誤提示；空輸入不報錯，按0處理；Focus狀態有視覺反饋。",
      "must_cover": true,
      "status": "in_scope"
    },
    {
      "basis_id": "BASIS-003",
      "type": "测试矩阵",
      "source_refs": "docs/software-design/test-plan.md",
      "content": "9个场景：正常相加(3+5=8)、负数(-3+5=2)、小数(1.5+2.5=4)、空+数字(0+5=5)、数字+空(3+0=3)、双空(0+0=0)、非法字符(a+5=错误)、边界--5(--5+3=错误)、边界1..2(1..2+3=错误)。",
      "must_cover": true,
      "status": "in_scope"
    },
    {
      "basis_id": "BASIS-004",
      "type": "交互场景",
      "source_refs": "docs/software-design/test-plan.md",
      "content": "5个交互场景：Tab切换焦点、Focus效果、Error抖动、结果过渡、复制结果。",
      "must_cover": true,
      "status": "in_scope"
    },
    {
      "basis_id": "BASIS-005",
      "type": "源码约束",
      "source_refs": "docs/software-design/deep-design.md",
      "content": "单文件index.html、无外部依赖、local_only CI。",
      "must_cover": true,
      "status": "in_scope"
    },
    {
      "basis_id": "BASIS-006",
      "type": "范围约束",
